=\"533\"></div><figcaption><a href=\"https://www.intc.com/news-events/press-releases/detail/97/intel-announces-new-class-of-realsense-stand-alone\">Photo: Intel, T265 launch press release ↗︎</a></figcaption></figure><div class=sd-cta><div class=sd-buttons><a class=\"sd-btn primary\" href=\"https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/products/sku/192742/intel-realsense-tracking-camera-t265/specifications.html\">Intel specifications ↗︎</a><a class=sd-btn href=\"#specifications\">All specs (4) ↓</a></div></div><div class=sd-specs><dl class=sd-rows><div class=sd-row><dt>Cameras</dt><dd>848 × 800 fisheye stereo<a class=sd-tag href=\"https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/products/sku/192742/intel-realsense-tracking-camera-t265/specifications.html\">Maker ↗︎</a></dd></div><div class=sd-row><dt>Shutter</dt><dd>Global<span class=sd-tag>Catalog</span></dd></div><div class=sd-row><dt>Field of view</dt><dd>163° diagonal<a class=sd-tag href=\"https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/products/sku/192742/intel-realsense-tracking-camera-t265/specifications.html\">Maker ↗︎</a></dd></div><div class=sd-row><dt>Baseline</dt><dd>63.8 mm<span class=sd-tag>Measured</span></dd></div><div class=sd-row><dt>IMU</dt><dd>BMI055, gyro 200 Hz, accel 62.5 Hz<span class=sd-tag>Measured</span></dd></div><div class=sd-row><dt>Output</dt><dd>USB 3<a class=sd-tag href=\"https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/products/sku/192742/intel-realsense-tracking-camera-t265/specifications.html\">Maker ↗︎</a></dd></div></dl><p class=sd-foot>Maker values checked 2026-11-03; Intel lists it as discontinued · 1 recording · CC BY-NC 4.0</p></div></div></div>", "specifications": "<div class=scroll><table class=spec-table><tbody><tr class=grp><th colspan=2>Published by the maker</th></tr><tr><td>Cameras</td><td>2 × OV9282, 848×800 at 30 Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Shutter</td><td>Global</td></tr><tr><td>Lens</td><td>Fisheye, about 163°</td></tr><tr class=grp><th colspan=2>Measured in these recordings</th></tr><tr><td>IMU</td><td>